diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 13461fa..f1b7876 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Add the `critical_margin` setting: readings past a limit by more than it raise `critical_high` or `critical_low`.
 - Fix `calibrate` accepting negative offsets beyond `max_offset`; the error now reads `offset out of range: {offset} (limit {limit})`.
 - Sensor ids are case-insensitive and written to the readings log in upper case.
 - The readings log keeps the uncalibrated value in a new `raw` column after `value`.
